                        "text":  {
                                     "text":  "Lovely place to be at to catch up with friends as the restaurant offers a choice of 7-course meals to keep both your mouth and tummy busy at work.\n\nI took on the NT668 set and the ordering itself took the staff a good 10-15mins to confirm all our orders.\n\nThe dishes were meticulously prepared and well presented to us but the staff team was pretty much short-handed during the evening’s full seating.\n\nWould recommend this place for persons who wants a good place for long conversions and good food.",
