                        "relativePublishTimeDescription":  "5 months ago",
                        "rating":  1,
                        "text":  {
                                     "text":  "We booked a lunch with friends and despite promising us they could cook a meal taking care of gluten and allergies, they were unable to do this. Most of the set meal could not be eaten once we checked sauces. They also have no ability to modify the food since most is precooked. Finally, after a lot of conversation in Chinese they messed up and brought out a suspicious looking brown sauce with our steak, which of course contained wheat once we asked. If you are celiac or gluten intolerant don\u0027t eat here.",
                                     "languageCode":  "en"
                                 },
